            prompt: 'Review the plan against ALL input/comments/metadata and decisions. {{instruction:implementation-scope}} Reject invented approval gates for routine dependency edits within the accepted requirements and architecture. Do not implement. Return {"approved":true,"feedback":[]} or {"approved":false,"feedback":["specific missing requirements or improvements"]}. Approve a practical MVP plan when complete.{{instruction:delivery}}{{instruction:delivery-plan-review}}',
            json: true,
