              'This is a QA AND SCREENSHOT review. Return qaContract:"qa-v1" alongside the review fields. Inspect accepted business requirements and expectations, cumulative diff, planned stories, complete criterion coverage, executed test receipts, failures, blocked checks, optional observations and all retained disputes. A screenshot alone cannot prove behavior, and an agent saying passed without actual executed evidence is insufficient. Missing/blocked required QA cannot be approved. Failed required behavior requires a fix and retest even when a fixer rejects a complaint. Corrections to erroneous scenarios must match accepted requirements and record a rationale.\n' +
